==Miscellaneous==
*Added 4 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**11,001 raises [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]]'s level cap from 20+30 to 20+40.
**17,900 grants +5 Uber Rare [[Catseye]]s.
**18,000 grants +1 Rare Cat Ticket.
**18,100 grants +1 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Shard]].
*Increased maximum [[Cat Shrine]] level to 60.
*Increased [[Ototo Corps|Ototo]]'s maximum level for the default [[Cat Cannon]] to 30.
*Added triple Speed Up for [[Battle Cats Officers' Club|Gold Pass]] members.
*Added screen shaking for when the [[Cat Base]] takes damage and when a boss shockwave occurs on certain stages.
*New enemy spawn mechanics:
**Enemies can now be set to spawn a certain amount of time after base hit.
**Enemies can now be set to spawn after a certain amount of Cat Units have been killed.

